{"id":"depresio_n","lemma":"depresión","pos":"noun","rank":3140,"glosses":["depression","depression (area of low air pressure)"],"ipa":"/depɾeˈsjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"depresiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-depresi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ella tiene depresión.","en":"She's in a depression.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1195723","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null]},{"text":"Sufro depresión durante el invierno.","en":"I suffer from depression during the wintertime.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705912","words":[{"g":"to suffer","l":"sufrir"},null,{"g":"during, in, over"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"winter"}]},{"text":"Cayó en una profunda depresión y decidió ultimarse.","en":"He fell into a deep depression and decided to off himself.","words":[{"g":"to fall","l":"caer"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"deep","l":"profundo"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"to decide","l":"decidir"},null]},{"text":"La Gran Depresión comenzó en 1929 y terminó en la década de 1930.","en":"The Great Depression started in 1929 and ended in the 1930's.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,{"g":"to begin, to commence","l":"comenzar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"to finish","l":"terminar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"decade"},{"g":"of / from"}]}]}